		<TRIO_INFO>
			<TRAN name="obrtp_tran_025a" title="거래내역 거래설명 수정" realdata="0" dessvr="9" >
				<TRBLOCK name="InBlock1" inout="in" _len="332" _ulen="248" >

ACNO^계좌번호^8^0^0^0^0^0^0
ASNO^계좌일련번호^2^0^0^0^0^0^0
TR_DATE^거래일자^8^0^0^0^0^0^0
TRAN_SRNO^거래내역일련번호^11^0^7^0^0^0^0
TR_EXPL^거래설명^20^0^0^0^0^0^0
MNPL_YMDH^조작일시^19^0^0^0^0^0^0
MNPL_TRNO^조작단말번호^39^0^0^0^0^0^0
MNPL_EMPNO^조작직원번호^20^0^0^0^0^0^0

